  {
   "text": "This is today's Item Shop for November 12th.",
   "t0": 0.2,
   "t1": 2.26
  },
  {
   "text": "Three things before you spend a single V-Buck!",
   "t0": 2.39,
   "t1": 4.4
  },
  {
   "text": "The A$AP Rocky Bundle:",
   "t0": 4.62,
   "t1": 5.86
  },
  {
   "text": "3,200 V-Bucks, instead of 8,800.",
   "t0": 5.97,
   "t1": 8.935
  },
  {
   "text": "Archetype and Overtaker are in the shop.",
   "t0": 9.245,
   "t1": 11.025
  },
  {
   "text": "Both from Chapter 1, Season 5.",
   "t0": 11.135,
   "t1": 12.955
  },
  {
   "text": "And 14 skins are on their last day, eight of them Epic.",
   "t0": 13.265,
   "t1": 15.923
  },
  {
   "text": "Buying anything today?",
   "t0": 16.223,
   "t1": 17.463
  },
  {
   "text": "Use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel.",
   "t0": 17.523,
   "t1": 20.303
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you for watching! Follow for more daily content.",
   "t0": 20.603,
   "t1": 23.085
